# A record of a known type without a text field that is longer than 1,024 bytes is invalid; the
# frame is damaged. (Its fields are also wrong here: no valid field set can reach 1,024 bytes, so
# the oversize rule is reachable only through an overlong line, see overlong_line.) A good frame
# follows.
CURIA1|220|BEGIN|0|0.1.0|1066|9|15|1001|Test Ruler One
CURIA1|220|FIN|1|
CURIA1|220|END|3
CURIA1|221|BEGIN|0|0.1.0|1066|9|15|1001|Test Ruler One
CURIA1|221|END|2
